{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\n\t\t\t蔡天鳳案在高等法院續審，控方結案陳詞，指3名被告是早有計劃犯案，各有角色，按計劃執行，又認為3人對案發前所購買的工具和裝備的理由，包括種花或餵狗等，是荒謬可笑。<br/>\n<br/>\n控方又推斷，導致蔡天鳳死亡的可能性有三個，當中以鄺港智按計劃殺害蔡天鳳的可能性，最能夠解釋所有證據。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n編輯：譚佩貞\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T15:23:53.299765+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":138,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T14:52:08+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T19:37:50.040522+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T15:17:27.248753+00:00","content_hash":"afa4da115513cbcd13875d772e8596d6ef3781148eba387ffe3d2a591fedc6ad","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}